// WHY A DECORATOR AND NOT A COUNTER INSIDE THE QUEUE
// --------------------------------------------------
// The only record this board keeps is `eventq::EventQueue`'s sequence
// high-water mark, and the queue writes it through `hal::IStore`. Both of those
