//
// WHAT IT ACTUALLY CATCHES, AND WHAT IT CANNOT
// --------------------------------------------
// `Store.h` says out loud that `put()` may return `kWriteFailed` with the
// stored value PARTIALLY UPDATED — a power cut mid-write is a normal event over
