// that is not where it thinks it is, which against the server's permanent
// unique index used to discard a whole evening of door entries as duplicates
// (round G4's C2). `boot_id` made that survivable; this makes it VISIBLE.
//
// It cannot catch the failure `Store.h` warns about in the same breath: real
// flash usually does not report wear-out at all — the write returns success and
// the cell reads back stale. Nothing above the driver can see that, and saying
